    "about": "Reviewed by iProperty Editorial Team, June 2025 Quick Summary South View is a freehold residential strata serviced apartment in Bangsar South (Kampung Kerinchi), Kuala Lumpur, developed by Paramount Properties Sdn Bhd under UOA Group. 1,204 units are distributed across 2 towers of 46 storeys each, with 602 units per block, on 2.13 acres of freehold land within the 60-acre Bangsar South master development. The project was completed in 2017. Built-up sizes range from 648 sq ft to 1,119 sq ft across 6 layouts in 1+1, 2-bedroom, and 3-bedroom configurations. South View is among the very few freehold developments within the predominantly leasehold Bangsar South township. The Kerinchi LRT (Kelana Jaya Line) is nearby, and the Federal Highway provides direct access. Main trade-offs are the high unit density relative to the 2.13-acre site, the compact entry-level unit sizes, and the Jalan Kerinchi area's peak-hour congestion. Key Facts Project name: South View (also: South View Serviced Apartments) Developer: Paramount Properties Sdn Bhd (UOA Group) Location: Jalan Kerinchi Kiri 2, Kampung Kerinchi (Bangsar South), 59200 Kuala Lumpur Property type: Serviced apartment Tenure: Freehold Land ",
